{"audit_run_id":"audit:0c3fc4486b734163a31ecddd1090e6af","completed_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","coverage_status":"covered","emitted_record_refs":[],"extensions":{"x-candidate-spans":[{"end_column":79,"end_line":3,"start_column":1,"start_line":3,"text":"Day-14 measurements from a napa cabbage kimchi brining trial. Forty-four small"},{"end_column":75,"end_line":4,"start_column":1,"start_line":4,"text":"fermentation containers were filled from one homogenised batch of shredded"},{"end_column":72,"end_line":5,"start_column":1,"start_line":5,"text":"cabbage and seasoning, brined at either 2.0 percent or 3.0 percent salt"},{"end_column":80,"end_line":6,"start_column":1,"start_line":6,"text":"(22 containers per level), held at 4 degrees Celsius, and opened once on day 14"},{"end_column":17,"end_line":7,"start_column":1,"start_line":7,"text":"for measurement."},{"end_column":77,"end_line":9,"start_column":1,"start_line":9,"text":"**One row is one fermentation container**, measured a single time on day 14."},{"end_column":75,"end_line":10,"start_column":1,"start_line":10,"text":"There are 44 rows plus a header row. Every container has a value for every"},{"end_column":35,"end_line":11,"start_column":1,"start_line":11,"text":"outcome; there are no blank cells."},{"end_column":32,"end_line":15,"start_column":1,"start_line":15,"text":"| Column | Type | Description |"},{"end_column":20,"end_line":16,"start_column":1,"start_line":16,"text":"| --- | --- | --- |"},{"end_column":87,"end_line":17,"start_column":1,"start_line":17,"text":"| `container_id` | text | Container label, `C01` through `C44`. Unique; one per row. |"},{"end_column":162,"end_line":18,"start_column":1,"start_line":18,"text":"| `salt_pct` | number | Brining salt level of the container, as percent salt in the brine. Exactly two values occur: `2.0` and `3.0`. This is the group column. |"},{"end_column":89,"end_line":19,"start_column":1,"start_line":19,"text":"| `ph` | number | pH of the fermented product on day 14. Unitless. Two decimal places. |"},{"end_column":122,"end_line":20,"start_column":1,"start_line":20,"text":"| `titratable_acidity_pct` | number | Titratable acidity, expressed as percent lactic acid by mass. Two decimal places. |"},{"end_column":127,"end_line":21,"start_column":1,"start_line":21,"text":"| `lab_count_log10_cfu_g` | number | Lactic acid bacteria count, as log10 colony forming units per gram. Two decimal places. |"},{"end_column":113,"end_line":22,"start_column":1,"start_line":22,"text":"| `firmness_n` | number | Cabbage firmness in newtons, peak force from a penetration probe. One decimal place. |"},{"end_column":159,"end_line":23,"start_column":1,"start_line":23,"text":"| `sourness_score` | number | Sourness rated by a trained sensory panel on a 1 to 9 scale, reported as the panel mean for that container. One decimal place. |"},{"end_column":75,"end_line":25,"start_column":1,"start_line":25,"text":"The five outcome columns appear in the order the study plan declared them:"},{"end_column":78,"end_line":26,"start_column":1,"start_line":26,"text":"pH, titratable acidity, lactic acid bacteria count, firmness, panel sourness."},{"end_column":31,"end_line":30,"start_column":1,"start_line":30,"text":"| Column | Minimum | Maximum |"},{"end_column":20,"end_line":31,"start_column":1,"start_line":31,"text":"| --- | --- | --- |"},{"end_column":23,"end_line":32,"start_column":1,"start_line":32,"text":"| `ph` | 3.96 | 4.54 |"},{"end_column":43,"end_line":33,"start_column":1,"start_line":33,"text":"| `titratable_acidity_pct` | 0.53 | 1.05 |"},{"end_column":42,"end_line":34,"start_column":1,"start_line":34,"text":"| `lab_count_log10_cfu_g` | 7.30 | 8.84 |"},{"end_column":31,"end_line":35,"start_column":1,"start_line":35,"text":"| `firmness_n` | 10.0 | 16.8 |"},{"end_column":33,"end_line":36,"start_column":1,"start_line":36,"text":"| `sourness_score` | 3.4 | 7.6 |"},{"end_column":66,"end_line":40,"start_column":1,"start_line":40,"text":"- Comma separated, UTF-8, Unix (LF) line endings, one header row."},{"end_column":56,"end_line":41,"start_column":1,"start_line":41,"text":"- No missing values, no quoted fields, no index column."},{"end_column":77,"end_line":42,"start_column":1,"start_line":42,"text":"- Row order is the container order `C01`..`C44`; salt levels are interleaved"},{"end_column":23,"end_line":43,"start_column":3,"start_line":43,"text":"rather than blocked."}],"x-expected-count-method-declarations":[],"x-explicit-directional-claims":[],"x-explicit-expected-count-sensitivities":[],"x-explicit-quantitative-claims":[]},"opaque_constructs":[],"parser_disagreement":null,"parser_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","parser_result_id":"parser-result:e34db14075cfe9fa1e94","parser_version":"0.2.0","provenance":{"actor":{"actor_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","actor_kind":"parser"},"created_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","method":"static_inventory","tool":"sc-referee","tool_version":"0.3.0"},"record_type":"parser_result","schema_version":"0.21.0","source_ref":{"content_digest":"sha256:b707f91a42b33f84816b62b9149805f77a8f3ada18a9861d99ab58974075a830","end_line":43,"locator":"DATA_DESCRIPTION.md:1-43","path":"DATA_DESCRIPTION.md","source_kind":"file_span","start_line":1},"started_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","state":"parsed","syntax_issues":[]}
